Usage: agent-deck group delete <name> [options]

Delete a group.

Options:
  -force
    	Move sessions (also those of its subgroups) to the parent group (to My Sessions for a root group) and delete the group and its subgroups
  -json
    	Output as JSON
  -q	Minimal output (short)
  -quiet
    	Minimal output

Examples:
  agent-deck group delete experiments
  agent-deck group delete work/api --force   # Move its sessions to the parent group (work)
  agent-deck group delete work --force       # Root group: move its sessions to My Sessions
